{"id": "DZt2BtXPz8Q", "title": "Video by kayn.marketing.co", "description": "Branding Secret #90\n\n– Standards Create Status.\n\nThe highest-status brands\ndon’t chase approval.\n\nThey set standards.\n\nWhen a brand is clear about\nwhat it believes,\nwho it serves,\nand what it refuses to do,\npeople respect it more.\n\nConstantly trying\nto please everyone\nweakens perception.\n\nStrong brands draw lines.\n\nNot to exclude people—\nbut to create clarity.\n\nRespect comes from conviction,\nnot consensus.\n\nFollow for more branding secrets.\n\n———\n\nKeywords:\nbrand positioning, brand standards, premium branding, brand perception, brand authority, emotional branding, branding strategy, creative agency\n\nHashtags:\n#brandingsecrets #brandpositioning #brandauthority #premiumbranding brandperception brandingstrategy brandingagency brandingtips", "channel": "kayn.marketing.co", "uploader_id": "74767837300", "uploader": "KAYN ™️ | WHERE VISION BECOMES REALITY", "timestamp": 1781762315, "like_count": 4223, "comment_count": 57, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-952104381209648a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 72.097, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fdmm2-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQOhy-ABEkzTYexh1yqrZ86EhGhhhbErNceT3T9WQ_702-eZw2nBHPRDIUTJZAkuPXCwnrPLldlVhqzKXZF1yfTZcj4lzQskHfnf6eM.mp4?_nc_cat=106&_nc_oc=AdrTdNkMTov2W38ixwW_ijvPzS0vikZCSajNXu1rLsMzOKTLv6aGiuITewuIb50xLVyeOaA8f-psfEFNp9Zt7vvD&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fdmm2-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=l8omecbQUjYQ7kNvwFbG1l6&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=hp81eCwUuUI8wnXWUvpqbA&_nc_ss=7b689&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQRvfaz3qQ4oXhJABX4Pn9a-8e1xmeggwnLH8bBhYVpb5A&oe=6AEF8C2F", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 72.097, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/